 * Compress Middleware for Hono.
 *
 * @see {@link https://hono.dev/docs/middleware/builtin/compress}
 *
 * @param {CompressionOptions} [options] - The options for the compress middleware.
 * @param {'br' | 'gzip' | 'deflate'} [options.encoding] - The compression scheme to allow for response compression. Either 'br', 'gzip', or 'deflate'. If not defined, all three are allowed and will be used based on the Accept-Encoding header. 'br' is prioritized when supported by both the runtime and the client; otherwise 'gzip' is preferred over 'deflate'.
